lence, the censorship anti-whistleblower policy goes into place.\n\nThat's why CA is going to be HUSH HUSH about the Stop Nick Shirley Act, and the news cycle will ignore it also.\n\n---\n# Take Action\n\nThat's why it's up to President TRUMP to make noise about it.  I've already sent a contact form message to the White House\n\nNow it's your job to do that, too.\n\nPlease go here\n\n* https://www.whitehouse.gov/contact/\n\nAnd submit a contact form message to President Trump saying that Gov Newsome is going to try to quietly allow the \"STOP NICK SHIRLEY ACT\" To pass, and that you want Trump to stop it with some tweets and truths.\n\n---\nTell him this Act is unconstitutional, violates the first amendment and equal protection and the interstate commerce clause.  Tell him it's violating federal misprision statute.   Tell him it's a deprivation of rights under color of law of everyone who pays taxes.  Tell him it's fraud and the enablement of fraud, which is a conspiracy charge.  Tell him its political racketeering because they are giving taxpayer paid entitlements to specific groups in order to get votes.\n\nThe California State Government is going to enable fraud by passing this law, and it will be telegraphing intent to violate federal law, every day, all the time.  \n\nIf they're going to shirk our laws, they have no reason being in our Union.\n\nI recommend that Trump say \"Stop this or get out of our union\" and recommend proceedings create a legal process for kicking California out of the union, something that is NOT POSSIBLE AT THE MOMENT.\n\nAlternatively, the federal government could simply pack up, and exit California, removing (selling) all their buildings, and selling off the federal land, and moving the federal employees out of the state (or they are fired); and then stop giving California ANY more money.\n\nThis is as effective as forcing them to leave the union.\n\nEven if the next Democrat restores all this, it will kick california so hard in the balls they'll be coughing up testicles for the next couple years and many many years to recover after that.\n\nThey already blame Trump for everything, so why not do this?\n\nSends a cautionary message to all other states that they need to stop fucking around and playing games with the rest of the country.", "author": "5DchessWatch", "created": 1787325483394, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "AmannamedRJ", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Gavin Newsom is going to do nothing and allow the \"Stop Nick Shirley Act\" to pass....unless we get TRUMP to intervene", "last_comment_created": 1787330440324, "content": "<p>If we do nothing, in silence, the censorship anti-whistleblower policy goes into place.</p>\n<p>That's why CA is going to be HUSH HUSH about the Stop Nick Shirley Act, and the news cycle will ignore it also.</p>\n<hr />\n<h1>Take Action</h1>\n<p>That's why it's up to President TRUMP to make noise about it.  I've already sent a contact form message to the White House</p>\n<p>Now it's your job to do that, too.</p>\n<p>Please go here</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/contact/\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.whitehouse.gov/contact/</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>And submit a contact form message to President Trump saying that Gov Newsome is going to try to quietly allow the &quot;STOP NICK SHIRLEY ACT&quot; To pass, and that you want Trump to stop it with some tweets and truths.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Tell him this Act is unconstitutional, violates the first amendment and equal protection and the interstate commerce clause.  Tell him it's violating federal misprision statute.   Tell him it's a deprivation of rights under color of law of everyone who pays taxes.  Tell him it's fraud and the enablement of fraud, which is a conspiracy charge.  Tell him its political racketeering because they are giving taxpayer paid entitlements to specific groups in order to get votes.</p>\n<p>The California State Government is going to enable fraud by passing this law, and it will be telegraphing intent to violate federal law, every day, all the time.</p>\n<p>If they're going to shirk our laws, they have no reason being in our Union.</p>\n<p>I recommend that Trump say &quot;Stop this or get out of our union&quot; and recommend proceedings create a legal process for kicking California out of the union, something that is NOT POSSIBLE AT THE MOMENT.</p>\n<p>Alternatively, the federal government could simply pack up, and exit California, removing (selling) all their buildings, and selling off the federal land, and moving the federal employees out of the state (or they are fired); and then stop giving California ANY more money.</p>\n<p>This is as effective as forcing them to leave the union.</p>\n<p>Even if the next Democrat restores all this, it will kick california so hard in the balls they'll be coughing up testicles for the next couple years and many many years to recover after that.</p>\n<p>They already blame Trump for everything, so why not do this?</p>\n<p>Sends a cautionary message to all other states that they need to stop fucking around and playing games with the rest of the country.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 7, "score_up": 40, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0YES\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2090582151284826299", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "